I think this is an example of the "drop gotcha", masked by data table.  See
http://pj.freefaculty.org/blog/?p=274

basically, R defaults to "demote" one column matrices to vectors, we avoid
that by additional argument drop = FALSE.  However, layering data.table on
top of that confuses the situation somewhat.

